13", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619485_3068016830070746_1944741136029033866_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5a5az76EXV4Q7kNvwGFBkf8&_nc_oc=AdqW_ssYDJ12jYH748KTxV2fzmbLvGUnA4o2RQOhMZOHS_4KTQ5hBVOTZYU1PeCymFg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJQC5Ey2OwNExpr-64X7Aj7hB5FFIV732rS3Wuo1jYCZg&oe=6AA9438D"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_065_0000.png", "id": "1805631137516612", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620875_1805631140849945_7857869342377884526_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FRFdMeJsJwAQ7kNvwFUMVqY&_nc_oc=Adql_nT5-ebx0iGhEypwiFjXvCr4o5BcN0rCYgzX7mhJXoNkin5LhzI0TFCaIhTOlh0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLcNHRL4-yodc4Ow39ZK99cIw6MEDPo1oLHMMSbZry7wg&oe=6AA96B02"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Image Sequence_005_0000.png", "id": "1592099439160214", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619404_1592099442493547_6642080100571952337_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qvetKW3MRvUQ7kNvwEaouCQ&_nc_oc=AdoNZtjfNBbB1p24j5ylGw8LPB_y6ku4_oO0Ik4nAW8mRJphqjkfDvaLRFxx0rpvp7Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIGaDIPilfVYxqf-J-PpXjZs3YDPshOUW85I-kmDuZILg&oe=6AA9662E"}, "display_name": "Ride: Fun Line Express", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Hop aboard this theme\u2011park\u2011style VR train ride and experience over 13 minutes of fun through a vibrant 3D world of candies, playful architecture, and animated surprises.\n\nThe train takes flight, gliding through rooms of bouncing balls, passing through Candy Lane air traffic, plunging into a thrilling 1000\u2011ft drop, and gliding across a massive 100\u2011ft wave in this fun, family\u2011friendly VR simulation experience. Take a break and enjoy a magical ride full of candies, colors, and fun.", "short_description": "Theme\u2011park\u2011style VR ride that ta